  "question": {
    "text": "If the equation of the tangent at the point <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> on the parabola whose axis is the&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi></math> -axis is <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0,</mn></math>&nbsp;then the distance of the tangent from the focus of the parabola is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2.5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Slope of the tangent is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />Slope of the focal chord through <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0076_66ee321d3cc7.png\" style=\"width:2.25347in;height:1.36667in\" /><br />i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>24</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math><br />Equation of the focal chord through <math><mi>P</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Focus is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Distance of the focus from the tangent is<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>"
  }
